<title>COLOMBIA: Santander begins Colombia coverage with five buys.</title>
<headline>Santander begins Colombia coverage with five buys.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment initiated coverage of eight Colombian banking and retail stocks with five buy recommendations, including one for Banco Ganadero SA, the country's largest bank in terms of assets.</p>
<p>Santander also recommended Banco Industrial Colombiano SA. It said it liked the bank's ordinary shares because they are trading at a 18 percent discount to the preferred shares and a 24 percent discount to the American depositary receipts.</p>
</text>
